{
  "slug": "savory-lentil-breakfast-bowl",
  "name": "Savoury lentil breakfast bowl",
  "description": "Warm cooked lentils folded through garlicky tofu, mushrooms and wilted spinach — a savoury breakfast bowl built for protein rather than sugar.",
  "iconKey": "bowl",
  "instructions": [
    "Warm the olive oil in a wide pan over medium heat and cook the garlic for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Crumble in the tofu and cook for 4 minutes without stirring, so one side browns.",
    "Add the mushrooms and the salt and cook for 4 minutes, until the mushrooms are golden and their liquid has gone.",
    "Stir in the lentils and heat through for 2 minutes, then fold in the spinach and cook just until it wilts.",
    "Spoon into two bowls and serve warm."
